Arm astcenc commit 631fb04
https://github.com/ARM-software/astc-encoder/tree/631fb04e1c4bca002a8b653f34e044dbb35b32b4
Licence: Apache-2.0.

unityrs-texture ports the decode-side ASTC foundations in
crates/unityrs-texture/src/astc/: block modes, integer sequence decoding,
partition assignment, colour endpoint headers and LDR endpoint unpacking.
The Rust port bounds reads, reports malformed blocks without panicking,
and charges the partition cache before fallible allocation. The source
revision is between 4.8.0 and 5.0.0, as bundled by astc-encoder-py 0.1.12;
no oracle parity is claimed in this part.

crates/unityrs-texture/src/astc/tables.rs is generated by
tools/gen/astc_tables.py from Arm astcenc commit 631fb04 (Apache-2.0): the
decode-only ISE, colour and weight tables in astcenc_integer_sequence.cpp,
astcenc_quantization.cpp and astcenc_weight_quant_xfer_tables.cpp.
The generator verifies the source files by SHA-256.

