zlib 1.2.13 (vendored)
https://zlib.net
Licence: Zlib.

unityrs-imageio vendors the deflate side of zlib 1.2.13, unchanged, in
crates/unityrs-imageio/vendor/zlib-1.2.13/ (each file's sha256 is in
vendor/zlib-1.2.13.sha256, beside the release tarball's), and its build
script derives an altered deflate.c in OUT_DIR, replacing only longest_match
with zlib-match/longest_match.c after checking the original span's SHA-256.
The replacement uses equivalent memcpy word comparisons and a portable byte
loop fallback; the vendored files remain unchanged. Tests compare the derived
deflate with pristine zlib at Pillow's settings, and complete PNGs with Pillow
9.5.0's fixtures. zlib's LICENSE follows; it is unityrs-imageio's LICENSE-ZLIB,
listed under Zlib below.

